<title>UK: AHB sets 1.0 billion mark seven-year pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 1.0 billion mark seven-year pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.59     PAY DATE    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/=     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 475</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
